{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$1$", "MATH_0005": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0006": "$F$", "MATH_0007": "$G$", "MATH_0008": "$T$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{X}_T$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{Y}_T$", "MATH_0011": "$a : F \\to G$", "MATH_0012": "$f$", "MATH_0013": "$a$", "MATH_0014": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{bootstrap-definition-morphism-representable-by-spaces}", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-map-fibred-setoids-representable-algebraic-spaces}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ac25ca98058866e549467035bef5967a93261cffd5e396e26f7da6390132a7f6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:56a1ef4e929e54e6fe0eb12efbd000665ea38be0d6bffb0aa92fde3d455b2b53", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an object of <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a <MATH_0004>-morphism of\ncategories fibred in setoids over <MATH_0005>.\nLet <MATH_0006>, resp.<SPACE_0001><MATH_0007> be the presheaf which to <MATH_0008> associates\nthe set of isomorphism classes of objects of\n<MATH_0009>, resp.<SPACE_0002><MATH_0010>.\nLet <MATH_0011> be the map of presheaves corresponding to <MATH_0012>.\nThen <MATH_0013> is representable by algebraic spaces (see\nBootstrap,\nDefinition <REF_0001>)\nif and only if <MATH_0014> is representable by algebraic spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:15744f78b0edfcfab06f91883689e56d829ebd9cfb01ed4ca24c6f77fc411546", "unit_id": "tag:04SY:statement"}
