{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}, \\mathcal{Y}, \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$1$", "MATH_0007": "$g : \\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0008": "$1$", "MATH_0009": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{Z} \\times_{g, \\mathcal{Y}, f} \\mathcal{X} \\ar[r]_-{g'} \\ar[d]_{f'} &\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[d]^f \\\\\n\\mathcal{Z} \\ar[r]^g & \\mathcal{Y}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0010": "$f'$", "MATH_0011": "$1$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-representable-by-spaces}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d7a5f3d7980b68c996abe22b3d76656c7c62c3a84dfc09c1c7b1554d05368c9b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c5960def93f47ad5c9b33dd5d0d4fb87f07829de84e248dec9ba795a74e4ba2c", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003>\nbe categories fibred in groupoids over <MATH_0004>.\nLet <MATH_0005> be a <MATH_0006>-morphism\nrepresentable by algebraic spaces.\nLet <MATH_0007> be any <MATH_0008>-morphism.\nConsider the fibre product diagram\n<MATH_0009>\nThen the base change <MATH_0010> is a <MATH_0011>-morphism representable by\nalgebraic spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:701d6f5e98c6c8d240ee16ca30a3c658ef41611a0a22f9892a4f5a1db7bf7e2f", "unit_id": "tag:0302:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c1dfe8a31f2d0830de4ce69f4f3e540dfc1c280c3aea5759e634d33125f76e6a", "source_text": "This is formal.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d8e889e90e5a24bd8f3e4701746eb2d4ddad3ffa3b34b067aa0e87e25af5cb7d", "unit_id": "tag:0302:proof"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}, \\mathcal{Y}, \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$g : \\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0007": "$1$", "MATH_0008": "$f$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0010": "$S$", "MATH_0011": "$2$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_{g, \\mathcal{Y}, f} \\mathcal{X}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-by-space-representable-by-space}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3524b8377cad5eab1d8217ace6e1211a9ab33fe943e1f583bb91c49da27eec21", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ce7f5ddd49516ec1850660872a49933ed730a56c4edcb4f931e1379f269b7c58", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003>\nbe categories fibred in groupoids over <MATH_0004>\nLet <MATH_0005>,\n<MATH_0006> be <MATH_0007>-morphisms.\nAssume\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0008> is representable by algebraic spaces, and\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0009> is representable by an algebraic space over <MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\nThen the <MATH_0011>-fibre product\n<MATH_0012>\nis representable by an algebraic space.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2c88e6c1e5502d4102a22b8a782804d41c0a2fe6fad18d4d47bd992b81bfd220", "unit_id": "tag:0300:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04SX", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_{g, \\mathcal{Y}, f} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{S}_F$", "MATH_0004": "$F$", "MATH_0005": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0006": "$G$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0008": "$1$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_{g, \\mathcal{Y}, f} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_{g, \\mathcal{Y}, f} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0011": "$F \\to G$", "MATH_0012": "$F \\to G$", "MATH_0013": "$F$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{bootstrap-lemma-representable-by-spaces-over-space}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{categories-lemma-setoid-fibres}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-representable-by-spaces}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{categories-lemma-2-category-fibred-setoids}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-map-fibred-setoids-representable-algebraic-spaces}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{bootstrap-lemma-representable-by-spaces-over-space}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:915e9a04a69fd0c929b087e22a3b331e65acc8a52305c75874e7e44b3f474c0b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:22282c19dfc8690c08ddd027fe6b92fd016870184662aca51155dac438ac0cd3", "source_text": "This is a reformulation of\nBootstrap, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nFirst note that\n<MATH_0001>\nis fibred in setoids over <MATH_0002>.\nHence it is equivalent to <MATH_0003> for some presheaf\n<MATH_0004> on <MATH_0005>, see\nCategories, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nMoreover, let <MATH_0006> be an algebraic space which represents\n<MATH_0007>. The <MATH_0008>-morphism\n<MATH_0009>\nis representable by algebraic spaces by\nLemma <REF_0003>.\nAnd <MATH_0010>\ncorresponds to a morphism <MATH_0011> by\nCategories, Lemma <REF_0004>.\nThen <MATH_0012> is representable by algebraic spaces by\nLemma <REF_0005>.\nHence\nBootstrap, Lemma <REF_0006>\nimplies that <MATH_0013> is an algebraic space as desired.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:be9782d575d180b1a4f6c6e5857adc8cb15bc60dd2185aa60b4e0f9796b348f5", "unit_id": "tag:0300:proof"}
